  "hints": [
    "Test with 5 + 3 first (works) and then 5 + 5 (fails) to isolate the correction path.",
    "The detector must be K + Z3.Z2 + Z3.Z1 - the final combining gate is an OR, not an AND.",
    "Adding 6 means driving the B2 and B3 pins of the second 7483, not B0 and B1.",
    "A floating TTL input behaves like logic 1 - always tie an unused Carry-In to GND."
